// Wally - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// Wally is the WebAssembly text language a wallet uses. A program is a
// module, so its Hello World is the smallest module with one export.
//
// The text form is the same as the WebAssembly text format; this entry is
// Wally's dialect of it, and the greeting is in its data segment.
(component
  (core module $m
    (func (export "greet") (result i32)
      i32.const 0)
    (data (i32.const 0) "Hello World!")))
